  "term": "identity",
  "definition": "In learning contexts, identity can refer to an evolving sense of who a person is in a professional role, such as being a teacher. It is built through experiences, beliefs, values, motivations, skills, and social interactions, and it helps organize how the person interprets their role and makes decisions.",
